Description: MINTI recon tool pack
 Reconnaissance tools curated for the MINTI agent toolchain. This is a
 metapackage that installs the core set of recon binaries that the
 minti-mcp-recon MCP server wraps with safe-flag defaults.
 .
 Hard Depends: nmap, masscan, whois, dig (dnsutils / bind9-dnsutils).
 .
 Recommended: theHarvester (OSINT recon — available in Debian main, Ubuntu
 universe; not all derivatives), amass (subdomain enumeration; in Debian
 contrib/Ubuntu universe).
 .
 Suggested: rustscan (faster nmap front-end, not in Debian — install via
 cargo), and golang-go (required to install dnsx + naabu via `go install`
 from upstream). See /usr/share/minti/packs/recon/skill.md for the manual
 install commands.
